## Lore

A member - or former member - of the Nightbane-controlled Warlords. Or he might
have been a gang member before changing from latent into a full-fledged
Nightbane. The character has a number of street-survival skills, but little in
the way of advanced education.

It is one of four skill packages for the Nightbane R.C.C. The packages are
guidelines: a Game Master may allow skills outside them for a convincing
reason.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-warlord');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-warlord';

